    "title": "Five on 5 - Senator Jeff Merkley - (D) Oregon - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Newsroom Staff ,\n11 hours ago In this Five on 5 interview, News Director Joe Sullivan interviews U.S. Senator Jeff Merkley. Senator Merkley discusses efforts to attract businesses to Oregon, expanding health care tax credits, and new legislation aimed at increasing nursing training and access to care. He also talks about addressing the opioid crisis with naloxone in schools, raises concerns about a U.S. military operation in Venezuela, and weighs in on transparency surrounding the Epstein files. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
